Subject: [PATCH] [SW-63684] script: new scripts added for rma tests

New scripts are needed to inject ECC and test RMA system status

Change-Id: Ifd7d81c66233d0f421711de3988a375e787b4332
Signed-off-by: Nina Gertskin <ngertskin@habana.ai>
